WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.441 --> 00:00:15.585
The general looked at Wukong, who was still in disguise.

2
00:00:15.605 --> 00:00:18.766
"The Tang Monk is heading toward our mountain?"

3
00:00:19.026 --> 00:00:19.906
the general asked.

4
00:00:19.926 --> 00:00:22.647
"Yes," said Wukong.

5
00:00:23.687 --> 00:00:26.708
"That is great news," said a demon captain.

6
00:00:27.908 --> 00:00:30.310
"Unfortunately there's also some bad news."

7
00:00:31.011 --> 00:00:32.892
Wukong pretended to look worried.

8
00:00:33.893 --> 00:00:35.915
Tang Monk has three companions.

9
00:00:37.176 --> 00:00:38.557
One is a big purple fellow.

10
00:00:39.618 --> 00:00:43.301
Another is a pig who appears to be quite lazy."

11
00:00:44.762 --> 00:00:46.944
general narrowed his eyes at Wukong.

12
00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:49.266
"And the third companion?"

13
00:00:50.867 --> 00:00:53.649
"The third companion is a monkey," said Wukong.

14
00:00:53.669 --> 00:00:56.732
"I believe he is Sun Wukong."

15
00:00:57.792 --> 00:01:03.116
"I was afraid that monkey was traveling with the monk," the general grumbled.

16
00:01:03.136 --> 00:01:05.738
"What does Sun Wukong look like?"

17
00:01:05.758 --> 00:01:08.520
"He's huge."

18
00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.582
Wukong pretended to shiver.

19
00:01:10.602 --> 00:01:15.966
"He has fiery red eyes and sharp fangs."

20
00:01:17.106 --> 00:01:18.948
"Oh dear," said a captain.

21
00:01:18.968 --> 00:01:24.212
"There's no need to worry about some silly monkey," said the colonel.

22
00:01:25.004 --> 00:01:27.086
don't care what he did five hundred years ago.

23
00:01:27.346 --> 00:01:29.247
We have a powerful army."

24
00:01:29.327 --> 00:01:33.110
"I heard the monkey talking," said Wukong.

25
00:01:33.851 --> 00:01:37.533
"He said he there's an entire demon army on this mountain."

26
00:01:39.675 --> 00:01:41.356
The general looked confused.

27
00:01:41.376 --> 00:01:43.578
"He hopes there's an army?"

28
00:01:44.839 --> 00:01:45.759
Wukong nodded.

29
00:01:45.779 --> 00:01:49.082
"He said destroying demons is good exercise.

30
00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:52.044
He has a magic iron bar.

31
00:01:52.736 --> 00:01:56.618
He can make it big enough to crush our entire army with one strike.

32
00:01:57.719 --> 00:01:59.460
But he doesn't plan to do that."

33
00:02:01.461 --> 00:02:02.421
A captain gulped.

34
00:02:02.441 --> 00:02:04.803
"What he plan to do?"

35
00:02:04.823 --> 00:02:09.445
"He plans to crush one demon at a time," said Wukong.

36
00:02:09.465 --> 00:02:12.166
"That way he'll get more exercise."

37
00:02:13.627 --> 00:02:15.428
The demons' faces went pale.

38
00:02:15.448 --> 00:02:19.190
"This is bad news," said the general.

39
00:02:20.071 --> 00:02:22.312
The other demons nodded in agreement.

40
00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:26.862
can all stick around if you want to," said Wukong.

41
00:02:26.882 --> 00:02:29.044
"But I'm leaving."

42
00:02:31.966 --> 00:02:33.787
A captain looked surprised.

43
00:02:34.768 --> 00:02:35.948
about eating the Tang Monk?

44
00:02:36.649 --> 00:02:37.870
Don't you want to live forever?"

45
00:02:40.031 --> 00:02:40.612
shook his head.

46
00:02:40.632 --> 00:02:43.554
"I heard our three leaders talking privately.

47
00:02:44.354 --> 00:02:46.676
They don't plan to share the Tang Monk with us.

48
00:02:47.696 --> 00:02:49.638
They're going to eat him themselves."

49
00:02:51.299 --> 00:02:52.820
The officers grew angry.

50
00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:55.341
"That's not fair!"

51
00:02:55.621 --> 00:02:56.301
said the colonel.

52
00:02:56.321 --> 00:02:58.022
"It's terrible!"

53
00:02:58.282 --> 00:02:59.022
said a captain.

54
00:02:59.923 --> 00:03:01.303
The general bit his lip.

55
00:03:01.323 --> 00:03:06.765
"If our leaders won't share the Tang Monk with us, they can catch him themselves.

56
00:03:08.606 --> 00:03:10.827
Let's gather the troops and leave this place."

57
00:03:13.328 --> 00:03:17.330
Soon Wukong could see the demon army marching away in the valley below.

58
00:03:19.591 --> 00:03:20.711
The monkey smiled.

59
00:03:21.231 --> 00:03:22.232
got rid of the army.

60
00:03:23.344 --> 00:03:25.606
Now I'll deal with the three demon leaders."

61
00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:33.071
in disguise, Wukong entered the cave.

62
00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:36.334
He came to a large room.

63
00:03:37.635 --> 00:03:44.400
Three huge demons—a lion, an elephant, and a raptor—sat on thrones.

64
00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:49.644
"The Tang Monk is heading toward the mountain," Wukong announced.

65
00:03:52.964 --> 00:03:53.745
said the lion.

66
00:03:53.765 --> 00:03:57.206
"Tell the troops to capture him."

67
00:03:57.426 --> 00:04:01.047
"The troops left," said Wukong.

68
00:04:01.067 --> 00:04:04.028
"What!" shouted the raptor.

69
00:04:04.048 --> 00:04:10.489
"Why?" "The Tang Monk is traveling with Sun Wukong," said the monkey.

70
00:04:10.509 --> 00:04:13.130
"The troops were afraid of the monkey."

71
00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:19.412
"So it's true that Sun Wukong is with the monk," said the elephant.

72
00:04:20.616 --> 00:04:21.937
monkey is powerful.

73
00:04:22.378 --> 00:04:24.279
We should leave the Tang Monk alone."

74
00:04:27.662 --> 00:04:28.463
said the lion.

75
00:04:28.483 --> 00:04:32.726
"We don't need an army to fight a monkey.

76
00:04:33.907 --> 00:04:37.369
We'll capture the Tang Monk ourselves."

77
00:04:38.991 --> 00:04:40.512
"You're crazy!"

78
00:04:40.832 --> 00:04:41.753
said the elephant.

79
00:04:42.514 --> 00:04:45.376
"Sun Wukong defeated Heaven's entire army!"

80
00:04:47.032 --> 00:04:49.874
"Don't call me crazy!"

81
00:04:50.254 --> 00:04:51.174
shouted the lion.

82
00:04:51.194 --> 00:04:54.656
"Don't shout at me!"

83
00:04:55.237 --> 00:04:58.218
shouted the elephant.

84
00:04:58.238 --> 00:05:01.160
"I'll shout at anyone I want to!"

85
00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:02.501
shouted the lion.

86
00:05:03.882 --> 00:05:07.364
As the two demons argued, Wukong began to laugh.

87
00:05:10.005 --> 00:05:11.486
Soon he was laughing hard.

88
00:05:12.326 --> 00:05:14.988
The demons stopped arguing and stared at him.

89
00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.628
The monkey looked down and saw that his disguise was gone.

90
00:05:20.648 --> 00:05:22.452
He gulped.
